<title>USA: Wainoco retains Burns as sale advisor.</title>
<headline>Wainoco retains Burns as sale advisor.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wainoco Oil Corp said Wednesday it has retained Nesbitt Burns as its financial advisor to assist it in the potential sale of its Canadian oil and gas assets in order to maximize shareholder value.</p>
<p>Wainoco Oil is a North American oil and gas exploration, production and refining company, with assets in the U.S. and western Canada.</p>
